WEBVTT

00:16:29.411 --> 00:16:33.250
in predana sva ljubezni drug
do drugega skozi spremembe v spolu

00:16:33.274 --> 00:16:34.842
in spremembe v duhu.

00:16:35.319 --> 00:16:37.942
Te ljubezni sva se naučila
v naših klepetalnicah,

00:16:37.966 --> 00:16:41.646
v naših klubih, v naših barih
in naših centrih skupnosti.

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:44.404
Naučila sva se ljubiti
drug drugega dolgoročno.

00:16:44.932 --> 00:16:46.104
TM &amp; KKM: Hvala.

00:16:46.128 --> 00:16:49.228
(Aplavz)